            <ArticleTitle>[Structural analysis of diagnostic efficiency of bodyplethysmography indexes in patients with bronchial asthma].</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>21-3</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>In the paper the probabilistic assessment of diagnostic efficiency of bodyplethysmography indexes in patients with bronchial asthma instead of the prevailing method of comparison of mean-value is carried out. It is shown, that the estimation of diagnostic efficiency of body-plethysmography indexes by probabilistic methods in patients with bronchial asthma has advantages in comparison with a traditional estimation of mean-value as allows to determine the information density of each size from a position of probability and to improve functional diagnostics of this disease.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
